{"id":"beschuldigt","lemma":"beschuldigt","pos":"adj","rank":3128,"glosses":["incriminated"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bd/De-beschuldigt.ogg/De-beschuldigt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sie wurde zu Unrecht beschuldigt.","en":"She was falsely accused.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"wrong, unethical"},null]},{"text":"Er wurde des Mordes beschuldigt.","en":"He was accused of murder.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"murder","l":"Mord"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe nicht getan, wessen du mich beschuldigt hast.","en":"I didn't do what you've accused me of doing.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"who","l":"wer"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Er beschuldigt sie oft, nie zuzuhören, wenn er etwas sagt.","en":"He often accuses her of never listening to what he says.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"often"},{"g":"never, never at all"},{"g":"to listen","l":"zuhören"},{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"something"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"}]},{"text":"Sie wurde fälschlicherweise beschuldigt.","en":"She was falsely accused.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"wrongly, erroneously"},null]}]}